Open the sidemenu
Click the "E-Chart" link
Type "Haynes" in the "sstring" input
Click the "Search" button

Begin Add Document
	Click the "Add Document" Link
	Click the 2nd "Text" link
	Click the "Show" Link
	Click the 3nd "Text" Link
	Type "Test subject of the 1st revision" in the "Subject:" field
	Type "Test notes of the 1st revision" in the @Text Area@xpath=//textarea[@id="file"]
	Click the "Add Document" button

Begin Edit Document
	Click the 1st "Edit" link
	Type "Test subject of the 2nd revision" in the "Subject:" field
	Type "Test notes of the 2nd revision" in the @Text Area@xpath=//textarea[@id="file"]
	Click the "Edit Document" button

Begin Check for previous revision subject
	Click the "Properties" link
	Click the 4th "0" listview item
	Verify exists "Test subject of the 1st revision" text